      "side": 1,
      "message": "The main reason this was included into `mm/gup.c` is that `gup_user_range()` calls `mm/gup.c`\u0027s static helpers (`is_valid_gup_args()` and `__gup_longterm_locked()`). If we compile `mm/gup_p3s.c` separately with a header for the prototypes, we would need to make those static helpers non-static (`extern`) in `mm/gup.c` (or alternatively move these definitions into `mm/p3s/gup.h` included by `mm/gup.c`). Which approach would you prefer?",
      "parentUuid": "888813a4_9eaaf691",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3,
        "startChar": 38,
        "endLine": 3,
        "endChar": 68
      },
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "803f8dd4fa8da24a07fa5e22643792390692183a",
